  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss4:2.3.5": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Asanta</i> can mean “non-existent”, but in this kind of context it often means “unavailable”. See for instance <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc46/en/brahmali#6.1.11'>Bu Pc 46:6.1.11</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc85/en/brahmali#5.1.7'>Bu Pc 85:5.1.7</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bi-vb-pc51/en/brahmali#4.3.3'>Bi Pc 51:4.3.3</a>. ",
